\r\n\r\n1. Aligns cell text to title text\r\n2. Removes the unnecessary gap on top of the tree\r\n3. Slightly increases cell height\r\n4. Hides unnecessary folding gaps from flat trees that don't have any nesting\r\n5. Adds missing horizontal gaps between cells on hover, pressed, hover-pressed, etc\r\n6. Adds theme constants for separation between text and checkbox/icon\r\n\r\n| Master | PR |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| ![1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0577c6d5-d1e2-45eb-a6a1-4565a16d1e32) | ![2](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8cdd67c-3213-44f8-9dba-0508bef13224) |\r\n| ![3](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7edccb6-5ac0-4b2e-b2cf-34d689c29672) | ![4](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/439dc812-dcd6-46f9-9d09-6e3bb5982558) |\r\n\r\nIt adds a new `TreeTable` variation for tables with moderate amount of data that are mostly drawn outside of the main editor window where they can have more space than regular trees, i.e Autoloads, Plugins, Groups.\r\n\r\nTogether with changes in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114392 this closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113910. The issue of hover highlight being drawn over empty cells happens in both themes and should be addressed separately.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/god